Z||000001||Gold-86SE||07-28-2000||12:00 PM||||<BR>Funny thing is the wife will tell you to stop spinning the tires, don't waste the money, yada, yada, while you drive.  But when she gets behind the wheel, look out! It's pedal to the metal, he!! bent for leather, and burn the rubber. Not that I have anything against that, its just funny to watch the wife run off with the toy.<P>And sometimes I find myself holding my breath until she is out of sight, just hoping the worst thought in my mind does not happen.<P>Safely concluded Fieros are fun for everyone, fun for a girl and a boy - a slinky commercial throwback there.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Gold-86SE (Fiero Collector)||||reg||1
