Z||000003||Bugsy||07-28-2000||02:28 PM||||My Lady has driven my go-cart only twice in the 14 months I've owned it.  She has her own  set of keys and a remote for the security system, but both times she's driven it I had to all but flatten the tires on her Gutlass.  She threatens to send me to Limo drivers school so we can go somewhere without me breaking her neck...LOL. Then she gets under the wheel, and I can hear her putting it through its paces.  When she returns, I hear the subwoofer rattling the body panels long before I see her pull in the drive   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <BR>And she tells me to grow up?....&lt;g&gt;<BR>------------------<BR>86 SE I'm addicted and proud of it<BR>Kevin<p>[This message has been edited by Bugsy (edited 07-28-2000).]||||reg||6
